mother nature~
Mother Nature~
Mother Nature is standing here, communing with the huge oak trees.~
Mother Nature's physical form is very hard to define, as it shifts constantly
from one form to the next.  The overall appearance, however, is feminine and
most definitely very powerful.  Not someone inexperienced players should be
messing around with.~
