sign large~
Greetings, adventurers!  Welcome to my forest.  Within you should find much
adventure and perhaps a bit of danger.  This is not a place restricted by 
level, for there are monsters here set at many different levels and degrees
of difficulty.  At any rate, have fun, and may your ventures be most and very
profitable.


           Grayghost, Master of Fate and All that is Inevitable~
