#9640
The Crystal Garden~
The first sight you see in this magnificent room is the incredible crystal
garden, made up of hundreds of crystals, that seems to be "growing" at your 
feet.  The amazingly beautiful crystals are colored every shade and every hue 
of the rainbow, and each glows with an inner brilliance.  The most amazing 
part is that every crystal is humming quietly to itself, each in a different 
key.  The over-all affect is truly awe-inspiring.~
